:: Day 5 EV

The thing that came up out of the weir sat down on the mill stones as if it meant to stay. Even sitting, its head was near half again Wren's height, and the water ran off its shoulders in ropes. Pip did not move, and neither did she.

[[It stands->The thing stands]]

:: The thing stands

Then it stood, and Wren saw how wrong she had been about the size of it. Standing, it was nearly twice her height, and the lantern light did not reach its face.

"Back," Pip whispered. "Wren. Back."
